## Summary

| Layer | Location |
|---|---|
| **Schema source of truth** | `proto/api/v1/*.proto` |
| **REST (public HTTP API)** | gRPC-Gateway on `/api/v1/*` |
| **Browser RPC** | Connect on `/memos.api.v1.*` |
| **OpenAPI (generated)** | `proto/gen/openapi.yaml` |
| **MCP** | `/mcp`, driven by embedded OpenAPI |
| **GraphQL** | **Absent** |
